<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>Child Protection Policy</h1><p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> <span>›</span> Child Protection Policy</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:820px">
<p style="color:var(--gray-500);margin-bottom:32px">Policy effective: January 2025 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Review due: January 2026</p>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:12px">Our Commitment</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px">Abhyaas The Global School is committed to safeguarding the welfare of every child in our care. The safety, security, and well-being of our students is our highest priority. We maintain a zero-tolerance policy towards any form of child abuse, neglect, or exploitation.</p>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Scope</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px">This policy applies to all staff members, volunteers, contractors, and visitors on school premises. All personnel undergo background verification before appointment.</p>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Safeguarding Measures</h2>
<ul style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:2;padding-left:20px;margin-bottom:20px">
  <li>CCTV surveillance in corridors, classrooms, and common areas</li>
  <li>Controlled access — entry restricted to authorised personnel</li>
  <li>Child-to-teacher ratios maintained as per CBSE norms</li>
  <li>Regular staff training on child protection and recognising abuse</li>
  <li>Anonymous reporting mechanism available to students and parents</li>
  <li>Designated Child Protection Officer (CPO) on campus</li>
</ul>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Reporting Concerns</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px">Any person who suspects a child is at risk must report immediately to the Child Protection Officer or school principal. Reports may also be made to the Child Welfare Committee of West Godavari district.</p>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Contact</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9">To report a concern or obtain a copy of the full policy document, contact us at <a href="mailto:<%= school.email %>" style="color:var(--green)"><%= school.email %></a>.</p>
</div></section>
